Feature: form-components-fixes
Target module: FormComponents (vUX-formComponents.js)

Fixed all defects found during the form-components verification pass (see
changelog/form-components-docs/ for the findings).

Crashes fixed:
- datePicker: static imports added for FormValidator and ListScroller (previously
  unresolved globals — default-range pickers crashed on open, datetime-local pickers
  crashed on build).
- datePicker daysToolTip: tooTipHandler/toolTipHandler typo normalized; refresh guarded
  until the dynamic ToolTip import resolves.
- file: selection no longer crashes when fileToolTip is off; cancelling the dialog no
  longer throws (empty FileList guard).
- slideSwitch.refresh(): now uses slideSwitchClassName/runSlideSwitchBuild instead of
  the radio builder's identifiers.
- file.refreshFile(): now calls runFileBuild instead of runSelectBuild.
- select config.optionGroupStyle: variable declared, and the value is now emitted into
  the generated stylesheet (.sOptionGroup rows).
- slideSwitch labels: missing label attribute falls back to "On"/"Off" instead of
  throwing; single-value attributes no longer render literal "undefined".
- radio: null-sibling inputs no longer crash (same guard the checkbox builder had).

Wrong results fixed:
- February now renders 29 days in leap years (wrong object key made the check always
  NaN); leap rule upgraded to the full Gregorian rule.
- select/datePicker sizeAttribute and wrapAttribute setters now actually validate their
  value (they previously validated the error message).
- Dropdown/panel placement now uses each widget's own rendered height instead of
  builder-level shared dimensions (mixed-size widgets were positioned with the
  last-built widget's height; the select's open-direction estimate also mixed up width
  and height for the search box).
- datePicker config.daysToolTipProperties validation now runs (loop compared against an
  array; error paths referenced undefined variables).

Cosmetic fixed:
- checkbox size error message named config.radioButtonSize; slideSwitch and file setup
  errors named nonexistent config keys; README's FormComponents import example pointed
  at vUX-formValidator.js.

Docs updated: doc/form-components.md rewritten where it documented the broken behavior
(window-global workaround removed, caveats cleared, optionGroupStyle documented,
"Known issues" replaced by "Remaining limitations").

Affected projects: any consumer of vUX-formComponents.js. Behavior is unchanged for
code on the previously working paths (verified against the myinvitees.com usage of
slideSwitch and file: both-labels-supplied markup, fileToolTip enabled). Note that
importing FormComponents now also loads vUX-formValidator.js and vUX-listScroller.js
(no import-time side effects; their CSS still loads only on initialize()). Deployed
copies of the library (e.g. myinvitees.com/lib/vUX) must be re-synced to pick up the
fixes.
